WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,420 --> 00:00:03,420
You can take so much alone and you won’t be able to use it all.

2
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:08,590
Do you want to divide the things in your box?

3
00:00:08,590 --> 00:00:10,590
These are very expensive outside. You don’t want them.

4
00:00:10,590 --> 00:00:12,090
Expensive does not mean useful

5
00:00:12,090 --> 00:00:17,780
This is really good stuff

6
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:22,220
What is the use of perfume?

7
00:00:22,220 --> 00:00:23,720
Facial mask can repair skin

8
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:25,220
At least pour it down and expose it to the sun every day

9
00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:26,220
Everyone really needs it

10
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:28,220
Isn’t it more appropriate to divide it?

11
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:30,790
Only when needed should be divided according to contribution

12
00:00:30,790 --> 00:00:32,790
Otherwise, who would be willing to do things with me?

13
00:00:32,790 --> 00:00:34,290
So it’s not who needs it who gets it

14
00:00:34,290 --> 00:00:35,790
Whoever listens to you will take it

15
00:00:35,790 --> 00:00:36,790
I didn't say that

16
00:00:36,790 --> 00:00:38,290
But that’s what you just meant
